OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment failings allowed Covid
OL,4,A'to spread like wildfire' in care
OL,5,Ahomes, inquiry finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 287-page report also highlighted
OL,8,Fshortages of PPE for carers and
OL,9,Fcriticised the way hospital patients
OL,10,Fwere discharged into care homes.
